WEBVTT

00:04:28.996 --> 00:04:31.076
which turns up all over the Roman world,

00:04:31.116 --> 00:04:34.276
including in graffiti in Pompeii.

00:04:34.316 --> 00:04:37.636
Some of my favorite Roman graffiti
from the city of Pompeii

00:04:37.676 --> 00:04:40.636
I won't try and do the Latin,
but it's translated to be

00:04:40.636 --> 00:04:43.476
"A hairy cunt is better fucked
than a smooth one."

00:04:43.516 --> 00:04:44.956
(Laughter)

00:04:44.996 --> 00:04:47.636
"It wants cock and holds in steam."

00:04:47.636 --> 00:04:49.276
(Laughter)

00:04:49.316 --> 00:04:50.476
There you go.

00:04:50.516 --> 00:04:53.796
However, I put it to you
that the word "cunt,"

00:04:53.796 --> 00:04:55.676
as offensive as it may be today,

00:04:55.716 --> 00:04:59.916
stems from a root that means
"woman," "knowledge,"

00:04:59.956 --> 00:05:02.636
"create," "cow."